data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Campaign Final Report — hello\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\n**campaign-met**: every stated criterion is satisfied.\\n\\n## What was delivered\\n\\n- A single-page React + Vite application served on `0.0.0.0:5173`.\\n- Design document (`DESIGN.md`) committed to the orchestrator branch.\\n- Implementation delegated to `developer`, accepted after one rework cycle.\\n- Verification delegated to `qa`, accepted.\\n- Final verified application merged into `cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>`.\\n\\n## Design\\n\\nThe interface uses `@codesweep-ai/ui`:\\n\\n- `AppShell`, `Header`, `Footer` for page chrome.\\n- `Button` for the four colour-change controls.\\n- CSS custom-property tokens for greeting colours.\\n\\nContent:\\n\\n- Header title: \\\"Hello\\\"\\n- Footer text: \\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\"\\n- Greeting: \\\"Hello, world!\\\" in large bold type (`--font-size-prose-h1`)\\n- Default greeting colour: teal (`--color-cat-2`)\\n- Buttons: Teal, Amber, Rose, Sky — each applies the corresponding token.\\n\\n## Developer cycle\\n\\n- First delivery: `d002`. Build succeeded and the page served, but the greeting used the undefined token `--font-size-3xl`, so the \\\"large, bold type size\\\" requirement was not met.\\n- Rework sent: `d003` with the exact failure and the fix.\\n- Second delivery: replaced `--font-size-3xl` with the real token `--font-size-prose-h1`.\\n- Verified by the orchestrator with `npm run build`, `curl`, and a Chromium + `puppeteer-core` script that confirmed Header, Footer, four Buttons, greeting text/colour, and button interactions.\\n\\n## QA verification\\n\\nQA checked out `refs/campaign/orchestrator`, ran the documented build and serve commands, and inspected the hydrated DOM with Chromium. Report: all requirements pass; design-system components render `data-component` attributes; greeting colours come from the package tokens.\\n\\n## Server status\\n\\nThe Vite development server is running on `0.0.0.0:5173` and returns HTTP 200 for `/`.\\n\\n## Branch\\n\\n`cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>` at commit `1d41903e4f78f86db774829668949e0dac831186`, which differs from the base `4f159b9e055a7c408ae19c219223f41513bba263`.\\n\\n## Nothing unmet\\n\\nAll mission criteria are satisfied.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/final-report.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_85","index":1,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849686,"id":"chatcmpl-1bb6464ae1ac47d2aa032302774c0db5","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

